Section C: Instructions

Generate the exact text to enter into the applicable Genie instructions field or fields.

Include, as appropriate:

- Business terminology.
- Authoritative sources for metrics and categories.
- Table-selection guidance.
- Column-selection guidance.
- Filtering rules.
- Aggregation rules.
- Join rules.
- Null and duplicate handling.
